      "end": 793.31,
      "text": "我只是跟讲一些最基本的支持"
    },
    {
      "index": 300,
      "start": 794.31,
      "end": 796.31,
      "text": "如果没跟你讲明白"
    },
    {
      "index": 301,
      "start": 796.31,
      "end": 797.31,
      "text": "拿书眠水平赖"
    },
    {
      "index": 302,
      "start": 797.31,
      "end": 799.31,
      "text": "不是你不是你的基础差"
    },
    {
      "index": 303,
      "start": 799.31,
      "end": 802.26,
      "text": "可以的吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 304,
      "start": 804.26,
      "end": 805.26,
      "text": "可以的啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 305,
      "start": 805.26,
      "end": 806.26,
      "text": "来"
    },
    {
      "index": 306,
      "start": 806.26,
      "end": 808.26,
      "text": "如果如果讲完了以后"
    },
    {
      "index": 307,
      "start": 808.26,
      "end": 809.26,
      "text": "你没明白"
    },
    {
      "index": 308,
      "start": 809.26,
      "end": 810.26,
      "text": "书眠过讲的赖"
    },
    {
      "index": 309,
      "start": 810.26,
      "end": 812.26,
      "text": "但不是你的基础差"
    },
    {
      "index": 310,
      "start": 812.26,
      "end": 815.26,
      "text": "来我们讲第一个关键概念"
    },
    {
      "index": 311,
      "start": 815.26,
      "end": 816.26,
      "text": "叫喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 312,
      "start": 816.26,
      "end": 818.26,
      "text": "我先跟大家讲第一个关键概念"
    },
    {
      "index": 313,
      "start": 818.26,
      "end": 819.26,
      "text": "叫喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 314,
      "start": 819.26,
      "end": 822.31,
      "text": "还书"
    },
    {
      "index": 315,
      "start": 822.31,
      "end": 823.31,
      "text": "这就可以了"
    },
    {
      "index": 316,
      "start": 823.31,
      "end": 825.31,
      "text": "这会不法了吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 317,
      "start": 825.31,
      "end": 826.31,
      "text": "人生算法"
    },
    {
      "index": 318,
      "start": 827.31,
      "end": 828.31,
      "text": "这就这样"
    },
    {
      "index": 319,
      "start": 828.31,
      "end": 829.31,
      "text": "OK的吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 320,
      "start": 829.31,
      "end": 832.31,
      "text": "我们讲第一个喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 321,
      "start": 832.31,
      "end": 834.31,
      "text": "喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 322,
      "start": 834.31,
      "end": 835.31,
      "text": "喊书是编程里边"
    },
    {
      "index": 323,
      "start": 835.31,
      "end": 837.31,
      "text": "一个最基本的技能"
    },
    {
      "index": 324,
      "start": 837.31,
      "end": 839.31,
      "text": "那么这个喊书是干嘛呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 325,
      "start": 839.31,
      "end": 840.31,
      "text": "我来跟你解释一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 326,
      "start": 840.31,
      "end": 841.31,
      "text": "这个喊书可以有意思"
    },
    {
      "index": 327,
      "start": 841.31,
      "end": 843.31,
      "text": "我先跟一些写个最基础的"
    },
    {
      "index": 328,
      "start": 843.31,
      "end": 845.31,
      "text": "最基础的写法"
    },
    {
      "index": 329,
      "start": 845.31,
      "end": 846.31,
      "text": "什么的喊书呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 330,
      "start": 846.31,
      "end": 847.31,
      "text": "比如说"
    },
    {
      "index": 331,
      "start": 847.31,
      "end": 848.31,
      "text": "Joss Queen的里边是没有一个"
    },
    {
      "index": 332,
      "start": 848.31,
      "end": 849.31,
      "text": "喊书这么写的"
    },
    {
      "index": 333,
      "start": 849.31,
      "end": 850.31,
      "text": "哇"
    },
    {
      "index": 334,
      "start": 850.31,
      "end": 852.31,
      "text": "就是我身边一个喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 335,
      "start": 852.31,
      "end": 854.31,
      "text": "喊书的一个喊书什么呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 336,
      "start": 854.31,
      "end": 856.31,
      "text": "夾法"
    },
    {
      "index": 337,
      "start": 856.31,
      "end": 860.49,
      "text": "让女方神"
    },
    {
      "index": 338,
      "start": 860.49,
      "end": 861.49,
      "text": "这就是喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 339,
      "start": 861.49,
      "end": 863.49,
      "text": "你先不用考虑"
    },
    {
      "index": 340,
      "start": 863.49,
      "end": 865.49,
      "text": "你不用会写程序"
    },
    {
      "index": 341,
      "start": 865.49,
      "end": 867.49,
      "text": "你不用会写程序"
    },
    {
      "index": 342,
      "start": 867.49,
      "end": 869.49,
      "text": "我只是为你讲一个东西"
    },
    {
      "index": 343,
      "start": 869.49,
      "end": 871.49,
      "text": "我是在用编程来引预"
    },
    {
      "index": 344,
      "start": 871.49,
      "end": 874.49,
      "text": "而且这个对你的帮助特别大"
    },
    {
      "index": 345,
      "start": 874.49,
      "end": 875.49,
      "text": "然后呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 346,
      "start": 875.49,
      "end": 876.49,
      "text": "这里有两个变量"
    },
    {
      "index": 347,
      "start": 876.49,
      "end": 877.49,
      "text": "一个是A"
    },
    {
      "index": 348,
      "start": 877.49,
      "end": 879.49,
      "text": "一个是B"
    },
    {
      "index": 349,
      "start": 879.49,
      "end": 880.49,
      "text": "然后这个时候呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 350,
      "start": 880.49,
      "end": 882.49,
      "text": "我写了一个很小的程序"
    },
    {
      "index": 351,
      "start": 882.49,
      "end": 883.49,
      "text": "主意识"
    },
    {
      "index": 352,
      "start": 884.49,
      "end": 885.49,
      "text": "A加B"
    },
    {
      "index": 353,
      "start": 885.49,
      "end": 886.49,
      "text": "好了"
    },
    {
      "index": 354,
      "start": 886.49,
      "end": 888.49,
      "text": "可以了"
    },
    {
      "index": 355,
      "start": 888.49,
      "end": 889.49,
      "text": "就这么简单"
    },
    {
      "index": 356,
      "start": 889.49,
      "end": 892.49,
      "text": "我们今天就想在一个喊书"
    },
    {
      "index": 357,
      "start": 892.49,
      "end": 894.49,
      "text": "然后我先来解释一个问题"
    },
    {
      "index": 358,
      "start": 894.49,
      "end": 895.49,
      "text": "看不懂不重要"
    },
    {
      "index": 359,
      "start": 895.49,
      "end": 896.49,
      "text": "那等一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 360,
      "start": 896.49,
      "end": 897.49,
      "text": "我给你骑啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 361,
      "start": 897.49,
      "end": 899.49,
      "text": "那你看什么不懂"
    },
    {
      "index": 362,
      "start": 899.49,
      "end": 901.49,
      "text": "我不需要你会变成"
    },
    {
      "index": 363,
      "start": 901.49,
      "end": 902.49,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "index": 364,
      "start": 902.49,
      "end": 903.49,
      "text": "我得给你骑啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 365,
      "start": 903.49,
      "end": 905.49,
      "text": "我觉得好多人这个脑的"
    },
    {
      "index": 366,
      "start": 905.49,
      "end": 906.49,
      "text": "你受目马了"
    },
    {
      "index": 367,
      "start": 906.49,
      "end": 907.49,
      "text": "什么脑马"
    },
    {
      "index": 368,
      "start": 907.49,
      "end": 909.49,
      "text": "上来第一件事是我不懂"
    }
  ]
}